{"id":"n57999-1-9","stage":2,"title":"밤 · 栗子","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57999-1-9-1","ko":"할아버지, 밤을 구워 주세요.","zh":"爷爷，给我烤栗子吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할아버지,","meaning":"爷爷，姥爷","explanation":"할아버지：爷爷，姥爷","readings":[{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74121","senseId":"1","lemma":"할아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}},{"text":"밤을","meaning":"栗子","explanation":"밤：栗子；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"밤","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57999","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밤을","audio":"/audio/abfcffcdcd9ec78298f3.mp3"}},{"text":"구워","meaning":"烤，烧烤","explanation":"굽다：烤，烧烤；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"굽다","audio":"/audio/f7b2a704ff9bb3f2aae4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60102","senseId":"1","lemma":"굽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구워","audio":"/audio/a04d1b9fcb3533105a79.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6600340ce9e158e7","term":"할아버지","zh":"爷爷，姥爷","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3","entryId":"74121","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的父亲或母亲的父亲。","pronunciation":["하라버지"]},{"id":"da9e530428ce1c2d","term":"밤","zh":"栗子","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3","entryId":"57999","definition":"一种褐色果实，外壳多刺，内皮味涩，可生吃，也可烤或煮着吃。","pronunciation":["밤ː"]},{"id":"f7b2a704ff9bb3f2","term":"굽다","zh":"烤，烧烤","audio":"/audio/f7b2a704ff9bb3f2aae4.mp3","entryId":"60102","definition":"在火上把食物烧熟。","pronunci